[{"title":"宫词 其六","author":"黎民表","text":"曾属良家在禁城，卷衣新得侍云屏。\n同来女伴无消息，唯记宫监旧姓名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6522,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻捷报 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"铙歌横吹遏彤云，天子明堂议战勋。\n金帛未应酬死士，麒麟先画霍将军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6523,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻捷报 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"翩翩朔气引戎旌，回望阴山斥堠平。\n用尽黄金饷边塞，几人曾为取龙城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6524,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻杜鹃","author":"黎民表","text":"咽月声寒露气微，三声湿尽楚人衣。\n从来北土殊栖息，何事南中久未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6525,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日同诸亲友泛越江作 其一","author":"黎民表","text":"水满金塘凫雁飞，吴姬双桨逆潮归。\n只愁杨柳丝难系，不畏芙蓉露湿衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6526,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日同诸亲友泛越江作 其二","author":"黎民表","text":"越瑟当垆发浩倡，门前初系紫游缰。\n银糟酒泼流霞色，不羡宜城九酝香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":6527,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午日同诸亲友泛越江作 其三","author":"黎民表","text":"鱼龙曼衍戏江波，天吴起舞翻蛟鼍